WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.841
It was time for recess.

2
00:00:15.842 --> 00:00:23.031
Eddy drove onto the parking lot.

3
00:00:23.032 --> 00:00:26.806
"Hey, slowpoke!" Zippy yelled.

4
00:00:26.807 --> 00:00:29.538
Zippy took off.

5
00:00:29.539 --> 00:00:32.886
"Grr!" said Eddy.

6
00:00:32.887 --> 00:00:38.520
He raced after the bully.

7
00:00:38.521 --> 00:00:41.321
Poppy was waiting for Eddy.

8
00:00:41.322 --> 00:00:46.195
But Eddy didn't see her.

9
00:00:46.196 --> 00:00:54.975
Eddy chased Zippy around the racetrack.

10
00:00:54.976 --> 00:01:00.860
They went around and around.

11
00:01:00.861 --> 00:01:05.699
But Zippy was too fast.

12
00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.563
"Ha-ha!" said Zippy.

13
00:01:08.564 --> 00:01:13.557
"You're slow!"

14
00:01:13.558 --> 00:01:20.804
Zippy shot back to the parking lot.

15
00:01:20.805 --> 00:01:24.088
Eddy sighed.

16
00:01:24.089 --> 00:01:29.581
"Zippy is a show-off!" he said.

17
00:01:29.582 --> 00:01:34.807
Eddy drove back to school.

18
00:01:34.808 --> 00:01:40.019
He turned into the parking lot.

19
00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.410
"Hi, Poppy," said Eddy.

20
00:01:43.411 --> 00:01:46.504
Poppy glared at Eddy.

21
00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:50.511
"Don't say hi to me!" she snapped.

22
00:01:50.512 --> 00:01:59.149
"You forgot to help me!"

